# BCDD

1. Fetch and follow the method. Do not copy it into this repo.

   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adadevoh/bcdd/main/bcdd.md

   Readable: https://github.com/adadevoh/bcdd/blob/main/bcdd.md

2. Then read this project's contracts. Skip `node_modules`, `bin`, `obj`.

   - `*design.md` — product
   - `bc/**/*.bc.md` — observable behaviour
   - `bc/**/*.spec.md` — mechanism
   - other root `*.md` (for example `README.md`)

Ladder: design wins on product, BC on behaviour, spec on how. Do not invent routes, clocks, or features. Do not change the remote `bcdd.md` to fit this project — product rules go in `blog.design.md`.
